        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Interchangeable Core (IC) Deadbolt</b>\r\n<p>\r\nSingle cylinder (Keyed lock (Lock cylinder not included) on the outside with thumbturn inside). Fit standard 2-1/8\" pre drilled doors. <br>Adjustable backset deadbolt for easy installation on wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nU.L., U.L.C. Listed, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, UL10B Neutral Pressure Rated.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for PDQ Interchangeable Core (IC) Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prop: Fits standard 2-1/8\" door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable 2-3/8 and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" throw with case-hardened roller pin. Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 2-3/4\" x 1-1/8\". Brass or stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Stainless steel or wrought brass.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible for Left or Right Hand Doors</li>\r\n<li>Interchangeable Core: Small format IC less core <b>(no lock cylinder)</b>. Compatible with Best, Falcon, Arrow  6 or 7 pin cylinders.</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder (ANSI E2152)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!--- <p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this deadbolt lock: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand <font color=\"red\"><b>Outside</b></font> the room or building facing the door<br>\r\n2. If the  \"Door Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Door Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/door-handing-picture.gif?v=1704352978\" width=\"410\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"handing of a door\">\r\n</p> -->",
